<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - LIHIR GOLD CUT.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - LIHIR GOLD CUT.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said it lowered its rating on Lihir Gold Limited ADR to market perform from market outperform.</p>
<p>-- Shares closed Monday at 27-1/2 and had not yet traded on Nasdaq.</p>
</text>
